      <description><![CDATA[<pre># HS Reconnect 2.0.1

- The Solo lobby overlay now works while HSTracker is running. You no longer
  need to quit HSTracker to see lobby names and ratings.

Requires macOS 13 or later and the native macOS version of Hearthstone. Supports
Apple silicon and Intel Macs. The app is unofficial and is not affiliated with
Blizzard Entertainment.</pre>]]></description>
